## PHP / Composer on Shared

Default `php` / `composer` may be 8.2. Always prefer:

```bash
PHP=/usr/local/php83/bin/php-cli
"$PHP" -d memory_limit=512M /usr/local/bin/composer.phar …
"$PHP" artisan …
```

## Deploy

GitHub Actions: `.github/workflows/deploy-siteground.yml` (build off-server, rsync over SSH). Full runbook: `docs/siteground-shared-hosting.md`. DNS zone is at Rebel (see project memory / that doc); wildcard may still send unset subdomains to Vercel.
